node_modules
**/node_modules
**/lib
# product-ext ships hand-written JavaScript: its lib/ is SOURCE, not tsc
# output like studio/lib is. Without this exception the extension arrives in
# the image as a package.json with nothing behind it, and the app builds
# "successfully" with no product shell in it.
!product-ext/lib
browser-app/src-gen
browser-app/gen-webpack*
plugins
*.har
tests
.vscode
electron-app/dist
